{
  "slug": "claude-code-setup",
  "name": "Claude Code Setup",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Analyze codebases and recommend tailored Claude Code automations such as hooks, skills, MCP servers, and subagents.",
  "longDescription": "Provides a `claude-automation-recommender` skill that scans your project structure, dependencies, and config files, then recommends the top 1-2 automations per category across 5 areas: MCP servers, skills, hooks, subagents, and plugins. Includes 5 reference docs covering hook patterns, MCP servers, plugins, skills, and subagent templates. Read-only -- analyzes and recommends without creating files.",
